# Microsoft Fabric Learning Journey

> A structured collection of my Microsoft Fabric learning notes — from platform fundamentals and data engineering to semantic modelling, security, monitoring, and end-to-end analytics architecture.

---

## About These Notes

These notes document my understanding of Microsoft Fabric from an **end-to-end analytics perspective**.

---

# Learning Map

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Microsoft Fabric] --> B[Ingestion]
    B --> C[Lakehouse / OneLake]
    C --> D[Transformation]
    D --> E[Bronze - Silver - Gold]
    E --> F[Warehouse / Analytical Model]
    F --> G[Semantic Model]
    G --> H[Power BI]
    H --> I[Business Insights]

    C --> J[Shortcuts]
    D --> K[Notebooks / PySpark]
    D --> L[Dataflow Gen2]

    I --> M[Monitoring]
    I --> N[Security & Governance]
```

